{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"deliveries","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AsyncQueues\/documentation\/AsyncQueues\/AsyncQueue","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","text":"AsyncQueue","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<[","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events11EventRecordV","text":"EventRecord","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]> { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Batches not yet read wait in a buffer of the newest "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"capacity"},{"type":"text","text":" batches; a slower reader"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"misses the older ones, and reads "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination\/records"},{"type":"text","text":" for what is kept. The sequence ends once the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"destination and every copy of it are gone and every batch kept has been read."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"One task reads the batches at a time; it can fan each one out to the rest of the app. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"first iterator to read holds them until its iteration ends or it is released; a second"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reader meanwhile waits its turn, logging a warning once, then reads on from the next batch,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so the first gets every batch in order. A reader cancelled while it waits returns "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/destinations\/inmemorydestination\/deliveries"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination\/deliveries","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"externalID":"s:12Destinations19InMemoryDestinationV10deliveries11AsyncQueues0F5QueueVySay6Events11EventRecordVGGvp","remoteSource":{"fileName":"InMemoryDestination.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination.swift#L108"},"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"deliveries","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","text":"AsyncQueue","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<[","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events11EventRecordV","text":"EventRecord","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]>","kind":"text"}],"modules":[{"name":"Destinations"}],"title":"deliveries","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"property","roleHeading":"Instance Property"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations","doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"text":"Each batch as it is received, whole, for a reader that waits for a delivery: a view that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"refreshes, or a test that reads once a batch arrives.","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations/InMemoryDestination/deliveries":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Each batch as it is received, whole, for a reader that waits for a delivery: a view that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"refreshes, or a test that reads once a batch arrives."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"deliveries"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncQueue"},{"kind":"text","text":"<["},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events11EventRecordV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EventRecord"},{"kind":"text","text":"]>"}],"url":"\/documentation\/destinations\/inmemorydestination\/deliveries","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination\/deliveries","title":"deliveries","type":"topic"},"doc://AsyncQueues/documentation/AsyncQueues/AsyncQueue":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/asyncqueues\/asyncqueue","title":"AsyncQueue","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/AsyncQueues\/documentation\/AsyncQueues\/AsyncQueue","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"AsyncQueue"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Elements in the order they are enqueued, kept until they are read; one reader at a time reads"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"AsyncQueue"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations":{"url":"\/documentation\/destinations","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations","type":"topic","role":"collection","title":"Destinations","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Where tracked events go: the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Destination"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol, the modifiers that narrow what a destination receives, and the delivery that hands it batches."}]},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/EventRecord":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/events\/eventrecord","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"EventRecord"}],"title":"EventRecord","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"EventRecord"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A tracked event: the event itself, when it was tracked, where, and the context it was tracked in.","type":"text"}]},"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations/InMemoryDestination":{"abstract":[{"text":"A destination that keeps the newest records it receives, in memory, for the app to read.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"InMemoryDestination","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/destinations\/inmemorydestination","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"InMemoryDestination","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination","title":"InMemoryDestination","type":"topic"},"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations/InMemoryDestination/records":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The records kept, in the order received, across batches."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"records"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events11EventRecordV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EventRecord"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"url":"\/documentation\/destinations\/inmemorydestination\/records","kind":"symbol","title":"records","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination\/records","type":"topic"}}}